      "status": "PARTIAL",
      "chunk_id": "text_1",
      "quote": "In detail, we report the interim results of the review focusing on two research questions: What is the efficacy/effectiveness of COVID-19 vaccines in preventing SARS-CoV-2 infections (irrespective",
