    {
      "element_id": "prisma_2020_4_e2",
      "status": "PRESENT",
      "chunk_id": "text_1",
      "quote": "We considered studies of any design as long as they had a comparison group that investigated VE against SARS-CoV-2 infection and/or asymptomatic SARS-CoV-2 infection after vaccination with an EMA-approved COVID-19 vaccine (see Supplement Part S2 for complete population intervention comparison outcomes (PICO) questions).",
      "reason": "For intervention effects, the planned comparisons are described as including a comparison group, and the manuscript points to Supplement Part S2 providing the complete PICO questions."
